Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 19:41:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] fix(opencode): correlate retry error lifecycle

Defer root-session errors until idle or a bounded fallback, cancel them when explicit continuing status follows, and prevent terminal blocked state from being overwritten by legacy idle events.
